Only the first prompt was written by me, but Opencode sends three user initiated prompts in this case.

* The first opencode initiated prompt is compaction. This is to be expected from previous messages from @rekram1-node. 
* The second opencode initiated prompt is the continuation prompt after compaction. This is not expected and should be an agent initiated prompt in my view.

This means that even with setting compaction to a free model, it still burns an extra premium request.

For comparison, the copilot-cli only counts the initial request.
